To descend into the further depths of Hack you must confuse yourself.  There
are several ways to do this and you probably already know them so I won't
list them here.  After you are confused, teleport, either ^T or wand or spell
will do.  You will then be asked to enter the level you wish to be teleported
to.  WARNING...  If you are playing 1.0.3 and you go to the lower levels
(AKA HELL) make sure you have a ring of fire resistance on or you have eaten
a dragon.  If you are not fire resistant you will be burned to a cinder.
If you are playing an earlier version the lower levels will also be mazes, but
each maze has another amulet.  Collect these for a REALLY hi score.


